*.node

# Created transiently when running `napi build` to regenerate the
# committed loader (see the index.js note below). Never committed.
node_modules/

# index.js (the napi-rs multi-platform loader) and index.d.ts are
# COMMITTED, not ignored: they are generated by `@napi-rs/cli@2.18.4`
# but the release workflow runs `@napi-rs/cli@3`, which no longer
# emits index.js. Committing the generated loader decouples the
# published umbrella from the CLI version. Regenerate + recommit
# whenever the `#[napi]` API surface in napi/src/ changes. See
# `napi/README.md` for the exact incantation and the CI drift guard
# (`.github/scripts/check-napi-loader-drift.sh`) that catches the
# "forgot to regen" mistake.
